WEBVTT

NOTE B2B Exam Prep intro (teaser v1.2): the narration, sentence by sentence

1
00:00:00.505 --> 00:00:03.229
Day one. New unit. New job.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.111
And the certification clock is already running.

3
00:00:06.597 --> 00:00:10.755
Five courses. One exam. Twelve months of experience.

4
00:00:10.926 --> 00:00:12.637
And nobody hands you the map.

5
00:00:14.905 --> 00:00:17.734
Introducing B2B Exam Prep.

6
00:00:17.945 --> 00:00:20.024
From day one to certified.

7
00:00:20.371 --> 00:00:23.016
Four quick steps, and it builds your plan:

8
00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:26.582
every step dated, from week one to exam day.

9
00:00:26.905 --> 00:00:31.438
The exam path: 26 dated weeks, monthly checkpoints,

10
00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:34.300
and two full simulations before exam week.

11
00:00:36.505 --> 00:00:38.617
The rules, explained in pictures,

12
00:00:38.637 --> 00:00:41.216
beside the real official documents.

13
00:00:43.745 --> 00:00:47.915
35 plain-English lessons, organized like the exam.

14
00:00:48.087 --> 00:00:49.534
Every picture plays.

15
00:00:49.718 --> 00:00:51.942
Every dollar rule has a try-it tool.

16
00:00:53.105 --> 00:00:56.803
It reads aloud too, in four voices that work offline.

17
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.100
(the app voice) “Hi, this is how B2B Exam Prep sounds.”

18
00:01:00.992 --> 00:01:05.663
Nearly 400 questions, each answer explained with a citation.

19
00:01:05.847 --> 00:01:08.979
Plus a timed simulator, like the real exam.

20
00:01:09.184 --> 00:01:12.368
14 flashcard decks that remember what you forget.

21
00:01:12.492 --> 00:01:15.716
Then the Arcade: seven games on the same content,

22
00:01:15.847 --> 00:01:18.019
five of them in real 3D.

23
00:01:18.189 --> 00:01:21.321
Range Day puts you on the qualification range.

24
00:01:22.105 --> 00:01:22.973
Ask Buddy.

25
00:01:23.905 --> 00:01:25.142
“When can I take the exam?”

26
00:01:25.305 --> 00:01:27.674
Answered from the guide, on your device.

27
00:01:27.858 --> 00:01:29.082
No signal needed.

28
00:01:29.405 --> 00:01:32.826
254 terms, all the FAR parts,

29
00:01:32.853 --> 00:01:34.931
every threshold and deadline.

30
00:01:34.992 --> 00:01:38.032
On your phone, your laptop, or your tablet.

31
00:01:38.203 --> 00:01:41.742
Updated as regulations and policies change.

32
00:01:41.913 --> 00:01:43.848
No app store. Free.

33
00:01:43.905 --> 00:01:48.866
Built by a 51C, for 51Cs and 1102s.

34
00:01:49.037 --> 00:01:50.550
B2B Exam Prep.

35
00:01:50.747 --> 00:01:52.589
From day one to certified.
